[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16680.629, "timestamp": "04:38:00", "text": "不舒服。我觉得你就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16683.189, "timestamp": "04:38:03", "text": "就像变得坚强，想要抓住先生一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16686.39, "timestamp": "04:38:06", "text": "鲨鱼在不知不觉中游了过来。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16688.39, "timestamp": "04:38:08", "text": "等等，硬化"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16691.551, "timestamp": "04:38:11", "text": "意思是就像你逐渐习惯了整体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16695.109, "timestamp": "04:38:15", "text": "不，不，我当时感觉有点……嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16698.629, "timestamp": "04:38:18", "text": "我不得不说，我在……期间吃不了多少东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16701.75, "timestamp": "04:38:21", "text": "恐怖事件发生后的第二天下午。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16705.31, "timestamp": "04:38:25", "text": "我当时就想：“啊？”为什么？发生了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16712.629, "timestamp": "04:38:32", "text": "就像骑师的胃病了一样。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16715.429, "timestamp": "04:38:35", "text": "恐怖片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16717.429, "timestamp": "04:38:37", "text": "我不知道那是怎么回事，不过当然可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16724.23, "timestamp": "04:38:44", "text": "你在Apex吗？你是什​​么意思？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16727.39, "timestamp": "04:38:47", "text": "不在 Apex 中。我们可以做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16731.75, "timestamp": "04:38:51", "text": "像吞噬一样，是的，我们可以做到，是的。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16734.551, "timestamp": "04:38:54", "text": "再说一遍，好像不是那样，而是那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16736.789, "timestamp": "04:38:56", "text": "感觉要出汗了。就像我不想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16739.189, "timestamp": "04:38:59", "text": "那。"}]